SUMMARY:Spookfest! Bounce House
DESCRIPTION:Put on your best costume and come join us for a scary-good time 
 at Main Library for Spookfest!\n\nThis will be a little pre-Halloween 
 celebration to help us get into the spooky season mindset. Come take part 
 in fun activities throughout the library (and outside) and trick-or-treat 
 at all the service points in the building.\n\nRegistration 
 recommended.\n\nFor more information\, contact: 
 chloebullock@dconc.gov\n\nSome fun activities that will be happening and 
 their locations are:\n\nBounce House - Outside (3-7 p.m.) (Weather 
 permitting)\n\nHaunted Maze - Children's Programming Room (3-7 
 p.m.)\n\nSpooky Cookie Making - Maker Lab (5-6 p.m.)\n\nScavenger Hunt (all 
 day)\n\nBook Tasting - Room 3214 (6-7p.m.)\n\n
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Chloe Bullock":MAILTO:chloebullock@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Durham, Food & Cooking, Social, Writing
UID:LibCal-14288-17922045
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17922045
