 okay! Join us for a lively discussion about YA books. You can find us at 
 the tables by the 1st floor bathroom near RTP Uncorked. The book club meets 
 outside\, so dress for the weather. Questions? Contact Sara Gibson | Family 
 Literacy & Community Services Manager | sgibson@dconc.gov\n\nNovember's 
 Book: Hick: The Trailblazing Journalist Who Captured Eleanor Roosevelt's 
 Heart by Sarah Miller\n\nBoxyard RTP\n\n900 Park Offices\n\nResearch 
 Triangle Park\, 27709
