SUMMARY:Survey Distribution and Tobacco Education
DESCRIPTION:The Tobacco team in the Health Education Division at the Public 
 Health Department is conducting a survey General Attitudes Towards Tobacco 
 Use and Feedback on the Board of Health Smoking Rule. Public Health will be 
 using feedback to guide the process of updating the Durham County Board of 
 Health Smoking Rule.\n\nFor more information stop by and ask questions on 
 the next steps or visit the following website - 
 https://dconc.gov/Public-Health/Community-Programming/Community-Wellness-Resources/Tobacco-and-Vaping
