BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261110T230000Z
DTEND:20261111T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T000000Z
SUMMARY:Mindfulness You'll Actually Use: Finding Calm in the Holiday Hustle
DESCRIPTION:The list is long\, the calendar is packed\, and somewhere 
 between shopping and the family plans\, you forgot to breathe. The holidays 
 can be warm and wonderful - and a lot\, all at once. If your shoulders are 
 already creeping up toward your ears\, this session is for you.\n\nThis is 
 mindfulness you can actually use. No sitting cross-legged for an hour\, no 
 emptying your mind. You'll try simple\, practical ways to steady yourself 
 and leave with a handful of tools that fit your real life. You can use them 
 in the checkout line\, a crowded kitchen\, or that holiday party you have 
 to attend.\n\nLed by Laura Bey\, a National Board-Certified Health and 
 Wellness Coach based in Durham.
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Alexandra Wurst":MAILTO:awurst@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Career Development, Community Engagement
UID:LibCal-14288-17290489
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17290489
END:VEVENT
