SUMMARY:Cozy Crafts: Knitting a Cardigan
DESCRIPTION:With cold weather approaching why not learn to make yourself a 
 cozy cardigan? This is a 10 week workshop in which you will learn how to 
 knit a simple cardigan. This program is for teens and adults. All materials 
 provided. We will be using 100% acrylic yarn\, but reach out if there are 
 any allergens so they can be accommodated.\n\n** This is a project that may 
 have to be worked on outside of class time in order to be completed. **
LOCATION:SLW Meeting Room - Side 2\, Stanford L. Warren Branch Library (1201 Fayetteville St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Danielle Johnson":MAILTO:dsjohnson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts
