SUMMARY:Puzzle Swap at Southwest Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Bull City Puzzle Swap at Southwest Regional 
 Library! All ages welcome.\n\nExchange your adult and children's gently 
 used jigsaw puzzles for new-to-you puzzles. Please be sure to check for 
 missing puzzle pieces before you bring them in. All remaining puzzles will 
 be given to Bull City Puzzle Swap for future events.\n\nThis is a drop-in 
 event\, so come anytime during the 2 hours.\n\nFor future puzzle swaps\, be 
 sure to check out Bull City Puzzle Swap's Facebook page.\n\nContact Carmen 
 with any questions: cruth@dconc.gov
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Stockdale":MAILTO:kstockdale@dconc.gov
