SUMMARY:Mompreneurs & Muffins!
DESCRIPTION:Mompreneurs & Muffins creates a welcoming space for mothers and 
 caregivers building businesses to connect\, share experiences\, discover 
 resources\, and expand their networks. This event is for the ones who have 
 their own business\, partner on a business\, and still keep it all together 
 for the kids. Join us to mix\, mingle\, and learn from each other! 
 \n\n\n	Snacks provided\n	Co-work & Collaborate\n	Games and playtime for the 
 kids\n\n\n \n\nHosted by SHEMEKKA®\, join our Small Business Center as we 
 create more opportunities to gather for North Carolina Women’s 
 Entrepreneurship Week™\, November 16–22\, in partnership with Global 
 Entrepreneurship Week and NC Women's Entrepreneurship Day.
LOCATION:Main Children's Programming Room\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ciera Williams":MAILTO:cbwilliams@dconc.gov
