SUMMARY:Mind-Blowing Facts of the Universe!
DESCRIPTION:Join NASA/JPL Solar System Ambassador Tony Verdone for a visual 
 journey through some of the universe’s most astonishing facts. Explore 
 unusual planets\, enormous stars\, supernovae\, black holes\, giant 
 galaxies\, and worlds traveling through space without a sun. The 
 presentation concludes with the immense scale of the observable universe 
 and what its distant future may hold.
