SUMMARY:Testers & Tasters Cookbook Club
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nTesters & Tasters Cookbook Club is a place to talk 
 about food and cooking!\n\nCome share your experiments\, experiences\, 
 triumphs\, and tragedies.\n\nEach month we highlight a theme\, ingredient\, 
 or cookbook and encourage everyone to prepare a dish to share and discuss. 
 \n\nFor our November meeting we're going nuts! And seeds! Choose a recipe 
 from any source that has any kind of nut or seed as an ingredient. Peanuts 
 are allowed\, though we know that botanically speaking they are legumes\, 
 not nuts. \n\nWhen you know what you'll be bringing\, please email the name 
 and source to dpeterson@dconc.gov.\n\nPlates\, napkins\, and silverware 
 will be provided\, as well as water\, coffee\, and tea. Bring your 
 mug!\n\nAnd don't forget some containers because there are usually 
 leftovers to take home.\n\nQuestions? Email dpeterson@dconc.gov or call 
 919-560-0238.\n\nRegistration closes 24 hours before the meeting\, but 
 email me if you've missed the deadline and still want to come.\n\nHappy 
 Cooking to all!\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Desiree Peterson":MAILTO:dpeterson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Food & Cooking
