 ecosystem where club members can learn\, play\, and connect through the 
 Pokémon Trading Card Game (TCG) and other activities designed for their 
 age range. Pokémon Clubs aim to be inclusive and welcoming to all young 
 players\, regardless of their skill level or familiarity with Pokémon. 
 Pokémon Club is not intended to be competitive. It will be a space 
