SUMMARY:Troubleshooting Common Home Problems with Home Repair Lab
DESCRIPTION:Any home often comes with problems to troubleshoot. Join Chris 
 and Mindy Meyers from Home Repair Lab to learn about troubleshooting basics 
 in this class! They'll share top troubleshooting tips for plumbing\, 
 electrical\, HVAC\, structural issues\, plus which projects to tackle 
 yourself and the tools/materials/skills needed\, and which projects to hire 
 out to a pro with tips for doing so. Relevant for renters\, homeowners\, 
 and first time home buyers. \n\nRegistration is required. This program is 
 geared towards adults. The first hour will be lecture\, followed by Q&A. 
 \n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please 
 contact us at Maker_STEAM@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at 
 least 3 business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best 
 accommodations possible.
